The experimental fa4_hopper package derives modified Hopper WGMMA forward,
softmax, backward, preprocessing and persistent scheduling methods from the
same FlashAttention revision. It preserves separate unscaled maxima and
logarithmic normalization, actual rounded-output delta, input-dtype P before
dS, one dS conversion, FP32 accumulation and late dQ/dK scaling. Unchanged helpers
use the pinned optional dependency. The derived methods retain copyright and
contributor notices under the same reproduced BSD-3-Clause license.
